First Floor Equipment Room
It is almost completely dark. Some faint light spills in from the west through the open door, allowing you to just discern the outlines of a series of shelves. By the door is a light switch.

>switch lights on
The lights come on after a brief flicker.

First Floor Equipment Room
By the flickering fluorescent lights, you see the crowded shelves of the equipment room.

To the west, the door to the corridor lies open.

You can see a length of ribbon cable and a battery here.

>take all
length of ribbon cable: Taken.
battery: Taken.

>out

